sequenceDiagram
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant O as Order
    participant K as Kafka
    participant I as Inventory
    participant P as Payment
    GW->>O: POST /order
    O->>O: CREATED
    O->>K: CreateReserveCommand
    K->>I: CreateReserveCommand
    I->>K: ReserveCreated
    K->>O: ReserveCreated
    O->>O: AWAITING_PAYMENT
    O->>K: CreatePaymentCommand
    K->>P: CreatePaymentCommand
    P->>K: PaymentCompleted
    K->>O: PaymentCompleted
    O->>O: CONFIRMED
